ion first.All `cli-*` json rows are nested benchmark reports — already caught by the `/benchmark/reports/` rule. The `deep-improvement/scripts/*.cjs` include the self-disengaging gate scripts. Let me find all gate/mirror-parity scripts to extend the `manual` list.Two additions needed: `scorer/cache/` files are frozen run artifacts, and `check-agent-mirror-sync.cjs`/`mirror-sync-verify.cjs` are the self-disengaging mirror gate → `manual`.1543 rows across both areas. `manual` only 2 — let me sanity-check whether deep-loop has other contract-bearing code (fanout/lineage scripts).`check-contract-drift.cjs` is a gate that *pattern-matches* `.opencode` authority paths — contract, not constant. Let me find all match-style refs vs constant-style refs in the code surface.Assembling iteration-006 with both areas' full tables.Iteration 7: `system-skill-advisor` (306) + `sk-code` (282) + `sk-doc` (280). Checking subareas and code surfaces.Adding `workspace-root` (advisor's root discovery) to the contract family, then generating all three areas.868 rows: 751 mechanical, 116 freeze, 1 manual (`workspace-root.ts` — advisor root discovery). Writing iteration-007.Iteration 8: the remaining 6 skills (552 files). Checking their code surfaces first.Installers here edit project-internal `opencode.json` or print snippets — `mechanical` constants, not external-state writers. Generating all six areas.552 rows: 412 mechanical, 140 freeze. Writing iteration-008 with all six areas' tables.Map C's real target is 4027 (the 231 `runtime:*` seed rows live in Map B). Remaining: `opencode:*` areas (306) + root (8) + ci (21) = 335. Checking code surfaces in bin/plugins/scripts first.Checking which plugin/gate files pattern-match `.opencode` (contract) vs carry constants.`check-no-spec-imports.cjs:26` is the durable guard on the `.opencode/specs` compat symlink — contract. The `launchagents` plist embeds a machine-absolute `.opencode` path — machine-local config. Updating the classifier.335 rows gene